From eed653372a5d14392d370125e404e0c9af4bfa33 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 04:27:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Split weekly quota cost at the reset instant

Codex and Claude now bucket local requests into hours, so This week
and Last week split a mid-day Weekly reset instead of counting the
same calendar day twice. Daily-only history falls back to exclusive
day membership until hourly data is available.

Co-authored-by: stabeyzhou <stabeyzhou@gmail.com>
